{"seq":2,"slug":"touch-gestures","title":"触摸手势","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-microinteractions/input-gestures/touch-gestures","wordCount":1367,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"触摸手势\">触摸手势</h1><p>浏览器告诉你的是「指针在坐标 (320,540) 按下，移动到 (410,545)，156 毫秒后抬起」。用户以为自己做的是「向右快速划走这条消息」。从前者到后者的翻译——把一串冰冷的指针坐标识别成有语义的手势——没有任何 API 帮你完成，它是一套关于阈值、时序和取舍的判定逻辑。这一节讲怎么把它做对。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>手势识别的本质是：在<a href=\"pointer-events\">指针事件</a>提供的原始 down/move/up 序列之上，根据位移、时间、速度、指针数量等特征，判定用户的意图属于哪一类手势。常见手势按指针数量和运动模式分类：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>手势</th>\n<th>判定特征</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>轻点 tap</td>\n<td>位移小于阈值、时间短</td>\n<td>等价点击，但能避开移动端 300ms 延迟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长按 long press</td>\n<td>位移小、按住超过时长阈值</td>\n<td>唤起上下文菜单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>滑动 swipe</td>\n<td>单向位移超阈值、速度够快</td>\n<td>删除条目、切换页面</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平移 pan</td>\n<td>跟随手指持续移动</td>\n<td>拖动、自定义滚动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>捏合 pinch</td>\n<td>双指距离变化</td>\n<td>缩放</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>旋转 rotate</td>\n<td>双指连线角度变化</td>\n<td>旋转图片</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  D[pointerdown 记录起点/时刻] --&gt; M[pointermove 累积位移与速度]&#10;  M --&gt; J{超过位移阈值}&#10;  J --&gt;|否, 且时间短| Tap[判定为 tap]&#10;  J --&gt;|否, 且按住够久| LP[判定为 long press]&#10;  J --&gt;|是, 单指快速单向| Sw[判定为 swipe]&#10;  J --&gt;|是, 单指持续跟随| Pan[判定为 pan]&#10;  J --&gt;|是, 双指| Multi{距离变化 or 角度变化}&#10;  Multi --&gt;|距离| Pinch[判定为 pinch]&#10;  Multi --&gt;|角度| Rot[判定为 rotate]\">flowchart TD\n  D[pointerdown 记录起点/时刻] --&gt; M[pointermove 累积位移与速度]\n  M --&gt; J{超过位移阈值}\n  J --&gt;|否, 且时间短| Tap[判定为 tap]\n  J --&gt;|否, 且按住够久| LP[判定为 long press]\n  J --&gt;|是, 单指快速单向| Sw[判定为 swipe]\n  J --&gt;|是, 单指持续跟随| Pan[判定为 pan]\n  J --&gt;|是, 双指| Multi{距离变化 or 角度变化}\n  Multi --&gt;|距离| Pinch[判定为 pinch]\n  Multi --&gt;|角度| Rot[判定为 rotate]</pre><h2 id=\"阈值-把模糊意图变成离散判定\">阈值：把模糊意图变成离散判定</h2><p>手势识别的核心是阈值。用户的手不可能绝对静止，「轻点」时手指也会微微滑动几个像素，所以必须设一个移动容差——位移在容差内才算 tap，超出就升级为拖动。同理，区分 tap 和 long press 靠时间阈值，区分 swipe 和 pan 靠速度阈值。</p>\n<p>几个有共识的经验值：tap 的移动容差通常取 8–10 像素；long press 的时间阈值多在 500ms 左右；swipe 需要的速度通常以「像素/毫秒」衡量。这些值不是绝对的，需要根据目标设备和人群微调——给老年用户的产品可以放宽时间阈值。</p>\n<p>速度的计算要用「最近一小段时间的位移」而非「全程平均」，否则一个先慢后快的甩动会被平均掉。一个常用的瞬时速度估计是对相邻两次 move 事件做差分：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v = \\frac{\\Delta x}{\\Delta t} = \\frac{x_n - x_{n-1}}{t_n - t_{n-1}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1547em;vertical-align:-0.8943em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8943em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>实务中常对最近几帧的速度做加权平滑，以抵消单帧抖动。这个速度值在用户松手后还有大用——它是<a href=\"drag-drop\">拖拽</a>里「惯性滑动」和<a href=\"../motion/spring-physics\">弹簧物理动效</a>里「带初速度的弹簧」的输入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多点手势-捏合与旋转\">多点手势：捏合与旋转</h2><p>捏合和旋转需要同时追踪两根手指，这里<a href=\"pointer-events\">指针事件</a>的 <code>pointerId</code> 是关键——你用它把两根手指各自的轨迹分开维护。判定逻辑基于两指间的几何关系：</p>\n<p>捏合看两指<strong>距离</strong>的变化。记录初始两指距离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，实时距离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span>，缩放比例就是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d / d_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，直接乘到元素的 scale 上。旋转看两指<strong>连线角度</strong>的变化，用 <code>Math.atan2</code> 算出当前角度与初始角度之差。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const pointers = new Map(); // pointerId -&gt; {x, y}&#10;&#10;function onMove(e) {&#10;  pointers.set(e.pointerId, { x: e.clientX, y: e.clientY });&#10;  if (pointers.size === 2) {&#10;    const [a, b] = [...pointers.values()];&#10;    const dist = Math.hypot(a.x - b.x, a.y - b.y);&#10;    const angle = Math.atan2(b.y - a.y, b.x - a.x);&#10;    if (initialDist == null) {&#10;      initialDist = dist;&#10;      initialAngle = angle;&#10;    }&#10;    applyTransform(dist / initialDist, angle - initialAngle);&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const pointers = new Map(); // pointerId -> {x, y}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function onMove(e) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  pointers.set(e.pointerId, { x: e.clientX, y: e.clientY });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (pointers.size === 2) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const [a, b] = [...pointers.values()];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const dist = Math.hypot(a.x - b.x, a.y - b.y);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const angle = Math.atan2(b.y - a.y, b.x - a.x);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (initialDist == null) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      initialDist = dist;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      initialAngle = angle;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    applyTransform(dist / initialDist, angle - initialAngle);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>多点手势的难点在于「指针增减」的边界处理：从单指变双指、从双指变单指（一根手指抬起）的瞬间，必须重置基准值，否则会出现元素突然跳变的 bug。</p>\n<h2 id=\"手势的取舍与冲突\">手势的取舍与冲突</h2><p>手势识别天生充满取舍，因为同一段动作可能符合多个手势的初期特征，必须做仲裁。最典型的冲突是「滑动」与「滚动」：用户在一个可横滑删除的列表项上向右下方滑，到底是想删除这一项，还是想滚动整个列表？解决靠的是「方向锁定」——在初始移动时判断主导方向，一旦锁定为水平就吞掉这次手势不让页面滚动，反之则放行。这背后离不开<a href=\"pointer-events\">指针事件</a>里讲的 <code>touch-action</code>。</p>\n<p>另一个取舍是 tap 与 click 的关系。移动端早期 <code>click</code> 有约 300ms 延迟（浏览器在等是否双击缩放），现代浏览器在设置了合适 viewport 后已基本消除，所以 2026 年大多数场景直接用 <code>click</code> 即可，不必再手写 tap 来规避延迟；只有在需要自定义 tap 行为（如和拖动共存）时才需要自己识别。</p>\n<p>最后一条务实建议：除非有特殊定制需求，生产中识别复杂手势优先用成熟库（如指针手势库）而非全部手写。手写手势看似简单，真正难的是把上面所有阈值、冲突、边界、跨设备差异都覆盖周全。手写适合学习原理和做轻量定制，复杂多点手势交给经过千锤百炼的库更稳。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>手势识别是在原始指针序列之上，根据位移/时间/速度/指针数判定语义意图，没有现成 API 代劳</li>\n<li>阈值是核心：tap 移动容差约 8–10px、long press 约 500ms、swipe 看速度，需按人群微调</li>\n<li>速度用相邻帧差分并做平滑估计，松手时的速度是惯性滑动与带初速弹簧的输入</li>\n<li>多点手势靠 <code>pointerId</code> 分离双指轨迹，捏合看距离比、旋转看角度差，指针增减时必须重置基准</li>\n<li>手势冲突靠方向锁定仲裁；现代浏览器已基本消除 300ms 点击延迟，不必再手写 tap 规避</li>\n<li>复杂手势优先用成熟库；这些识别出的手势直接喂给<a href=\"drag-drop\">拖拽</a>与<a href=\"../motion/spring-physics\">弹簧物理动效</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"触摸手势","id":"触摸手势"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"阈值：把模糊意图变成离散判定","id":"阈值-把模糊意图变成离散判定"},{"level":2,"text":"多点手势：捏合与旋转","id":"多点手势-捏合与旋转"},{"level":2,"text":"手势的取舍与冲突","id":"手势的取舍与冲突"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"指针事件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-microinteractions/input-gestures/pointer-events"},"next":{"title":"拖拽","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-microinteractions/input-gestures/drag-drop"}}